1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_epoch_bug_crossretain.sas - Bug regression: CROSS flag retained
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_epoch
5           * Expected         : _CROSS_ is a per-record flag; a record with missing STDTC
6           *                    cannot inherit _CROSS_=1 from the previous record
7           * Status           : OPEN
8           * Original defect  : _CROSS_ is assigned only inside the match branch, so within
9           *                    one subject group it keeps the previous record value when
10          *                    the event date is missing
11          * Test passes when the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED)
12          *============================================================================*/
